/p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Lưu ý:</p>\n<p>Chất lượng hàng được kiểm tra quản lý chặt chẽ, tuy nhiên vì những lý do như ánh sáng và chụp ảnh, thiết bị hiển thị nên sẽ có một chút khoảng cách giữa sản phẩm thực tế và hình ảnh</p>\n<p>Các vấn đề như sự sai lệch màu sắc nhẹ là không thể tránh khỏi, không phải vấn đề chất lượng<img src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/99/71/05/3c9023c57673493d73470bb8b3945035.jpg\" alt=\"997105a79dbd75fd1b8bfee5baf85eee.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/e6/c3/2a/c9546c8644a5a4dcf364f5df43bf48c3.jpg\" alt=\"e6c32ae55d31a9e446c144887614a795.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/e6/94/fa/df2a561742100d697f16bc7eb1dbbcb0.jpg\" alt=\"e694fa91fc8672040eb823c9266ccabb.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/e6/e1/80/539a24d1c0725f7b9f72c74f9513057b.jpg\" alt=\"e6e180181423be1fc06b8f187436c493.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/6f/7f/e4/bbc269b0fbcb03c85a38f61c295504c0.jpg\" alt=\"6f7fe4c4b1356a7ec77b0525e891e6bc.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/bc/8c/ee/14a2aa6fd5cef81907e6abb598636669.jpg\" alt=\"bc8cee346523ed0ecff5503c44e79339.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/0e/6d/e8/cb7609f85588feec9aca93fbd551ce88.jpg\" alt=\"0e6de83f509a89165de3943706ee9d9d.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/d7/fd/c1/34aea9adbd412b2ac371ff084cd52cac.jpg\" alt=\"d7fdc1074f205421d8ce125c6bed4917.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/fa/83/2c/5ace9e5879f6f497bcc1db26d4e81cd9.jpg\" alt=\"fa832c2b3ccdbadbc91c491730b3d756.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/1f/c3/00/e83624e9f6507bec024ece41f8976683.jpg\" alt=\"1fc30092084923206489f74e30c83eaf.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/b0/20/9