do shop tự chụp không qua bất cứ chỉnh sửa nào</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\"><img src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/d5/40/3b/45272529e99e4af8a54df06714aebe1d.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /></span></p>\n<p><img title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/c8/d1/e0/e69d98fbb8c48b6b0b12ac786e0ff8ea.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"839\" /></p>\n<p><img title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/4b/9b/7e/e8e5fa46dede9ba19bf5e33399d5568b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"800\" /></p>\n<p><img title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/c7/a2/9f/aabcbc55330521eb1830d6b57b34050b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"725\" /></p>\n<p><img title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/da/f3/34/7d0733c20bb6199ba4a026a07ec80421.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"767\" /></p>\n<p><img title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/54/04/a2/1b38b88d38e40c61ac280536c6b2d8b0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"436\" /></p>\n<p><img title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/14/cf/e8/8d011e4dc488a71e6a6c795e3d8a7e37.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"786\" /></p>\n<p><img title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/43/31/5b/ec2b72c047daa219c6a34af0d0fddf23.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"594\" /></p>\n<p><img title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/85/54/fa/f9a21f0d0e7924087329bb35693df054.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"602\" /></p>\n<p><img title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/33/65/88/7b3e6bc9876f3a4e0a199b467baaf618.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"551\" /></p>\n<p><img title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/f1/b6/85/d86ea760b08f5d1d6ba24ad757004e0e.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"313\" /></p>\n<p><img title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/5a/86/a6/5bbd7162bed28bfa4f33f11b7f08b10f.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"841\" /></p>\n<p><img title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/6b/99/6a/09df5adda1e9595e852e762551c206